From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:38:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Limit cumulative native SQL CPU within actor events

Sample short native segments and measure callback segments directly. Preserve transaction cleanup and keep the object-abort helper within the platform runtime.

diff --git a/src/workerd/api/sql.c++ b/src/workerd/api/sql.c++
index 0eeba4011ad75503336ae30041802ece4eda4738..f161e2fa9e9dca46e131d8d010f90a288ab42354 100644
--- a/src/workerd/api/sql.c++
